{"id":"wb-8-332","name":"永泰庄寨建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"永泰庄寨建筑群","text":"永泰庄寨建筑群是位于中国福建省福州市永泰县的5处清代庄寨建筑的合称，包括仁和庄、昇平庄、积善堂、绍安庄、中埔寨，面积多为3000~10000平方米，均为木构建筑，2019年被列为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B8%E6%B3%B0%E5%BA%84%E5%AF%A8%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":93386582,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93386582","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":null}